  "hints": [
    "Counting every i < j where |nums[i] - nums[j]| == k can be done in O(n) with a frequency map.",
    "If k < 0 return 0. If k == 0 sum c*(c-1)//2 for every frequency c. If k > 0 sum freq[x] * freq[x + k] for each unique key x.",
    "Pseudocode:\n  freq = Counter(nums)\n  if k == 0: return sum(c * (c - 1) // 2 for c in freq.values())\n  return sum(freq[x] * freq.get(x + k, 0) for x in freq)"
  ],
